# H1 `mcphttp methodnotfound`: the run's loopback HTTP MCP server answers
# `server/discover` with HTTP 200 and the JSON-RPC error -32601, as the MCP
# research's harness need 1 asks, rather than `ready`'s bare 404. fx v0.0.16
# reads it as a legacy answer and goes on to `initialize`
# (vercel-labs/fx@481104fd src/mcp/core/era.zig:387-402), so the server comes
# up ready with its one tool; the fixture's log has each frame and the mode it
# was answered in. xfx sends no discover and is ready by `initialize` alone.
mcphttp methodnotfound
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json h1-mcp.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json h1-mcp.json
wait 5
type /mcp list
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap ready
key Escape
wait 0.5
gwlog
